@HostAddress = http://localhost:5111
@Token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 1. Register User (Langsung)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/Auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Budi Santoso",
  "email": "budi@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 1a. Kirim OTP Register ke Email
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/Auth/register/send-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "budi@example.com"
}

### 1b. Verifikasi OTP & Selesaikan Register
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/Auth/register/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Budi Santoso",
  "email": "budi@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "otpCode": "123456"
}

### 1c. Kirim OTP Lupa Password ke Email
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/Auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "budi@example.com"
}

### 1d. Reset Password dengan OTP
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/Auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "budi@example.com",
  "otpCode": "123456",
  "newPassword": "NewSecurePassword2026!",
  "confirmPassword": "NewSecurePassword2026!"
}

### 1e. Kirim OTP Ganti Password (User Login)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/Auth/change-password/send-otp
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### 1f. Bersihkan Sampah/Cache OTP dari Database
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/Auth/otp/cleanup

### 2. Login User
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "budi@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 3. Get User Profile (Auth/me)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/Auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### 4. Get User Profile (User/profile)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/User/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### 5. Update User Profile
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/User/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Budi Santoso, S.Kom",
  "phoneNumber": "081234567890",
  "bio": "Mengatur keuangan keluarga lebih bijak.",
  "avatarColor": "from-emerald-500 to-teal-600",
  "avatarIcon": "wallet"
}

### 6. Change Password
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/Auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "Password123!",
  "newPassword": "NewSecurePassword2026!"
}

### 7. Get Account Stats
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/User/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### ---------------- WALLET & TRANSFER ----------------

### 8. Get All Wallets
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/Wallet
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### 9. Create Wallet
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/Wallet
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "BCA Utama",
  "type": "Bank",
  "balance": 5000000
}

### 10. Transfer Saldo Antar Dompet
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/Wallet/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromWalletId": 1,
  "toWalletId": 2,
  "amount": 250000,
  "adminFee": 2500,
  "date": "2026-08-25T10:00:00Z",
  "notes": "Transfer uang jajan"
}

### ---------------- SAVINGS GOALS ----------------

### 11. Get All Savings Goals
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/Goals
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### 12. Create Savings Goal
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/Goals
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Beli Laptop M3 Pro",
  "targetAmount": 28000000,
  "currentAmount": 2000000,
  "targetDate": "2026-12-31T00:00:00Z",
  "category": "Elektronik",
  "color": "blue",
  "icon": "laptop",
  "description": "Tabungan untuk upgrade laptop kerja utama"
}

### 13. Deposit to Savings Goal
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/Goals/1/deposit
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 1000000,
  "walletId": 1,
  "note": "Setoran gaji bulan ini",
  "date": "2026-08-25T12:00:00Z"
}

### 14. Delete Savings Goal
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/Goals/1
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### ---------------- RECURRING BILLS ----------------

### 15. Get All Recurring Bills
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/Bills
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### 16. Create Recurring Bill
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/Bills
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Netflix Premium",
  "amount": 186000,
  "dueDate": "2026-09-01T00:00:00Z",
  "frequency": "monthly",
  "reminderDays": 3,
  "notes": "Langganan streaming bulanan"
}

### 17. Pay Recurring Bill
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/Bills/1/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletId": 1,
  "amount": 186000,
  "paymentDate": "2026-08-25T12:00:00Z",
  "note": "Pembayaran Netflix via BCA"
}

### 18. Toggle Recurring Bill Status
PATCH {{HostAddress}}/api/Bills/1/toggle-status
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### ---------------- REPORTS & ANALYTICS ----------------

### 19. Get Report Summary
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/Reports/summary?startDate=2026-08-01T00:00:00Z&endDate=2026-08-31T23:59:59Z
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### 20. Get Cashflow Trend
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/Reports/cashflow?period=monthly&year=2026
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### 21. Get Category Breakdown
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/Reports/category-breakdown?type=Expense&startDate=2026-08-01T00:00:00Z&endDate=2026-08-31T23:59:59Z
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
